{"verse_key": "10:84", "surah": 10, "verse": 84, "text_uthmani": "وَقَالَ مُوسَىٰ يَـٰقَوْمِ إِن كُنتُمْ ءَامَنتُم بِٱللَّهِ فَعَلَيْهِ تَوَكَّلُوٓا۟ إِن كُنتُم مُّسْلِمِينَ", "translation": "And Moses said, \"O my people, if you have believed in Allāh, then rely upon Him, if you should be Muslims [i.e., submitting to Him].\"", "verse_from_ms": 1841540, "verse_to_ms": 1859830, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/10.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "وَقَالَ", "start_ms": 1841540, "end_ms": 1842710}, {"i": 1, "text": "مُوسَىٰ", "start_ms": 1842710, "end_ms": 1843420}, {"i": 2, "text": "يَـٰقَوْمِ", "start_ms": 1843420, "end_ms": 1844350}, {"i": 3, "text": "إِن", "start_ms": 1844350, "end_ms": 1845270}, {"i": 4, "text": "كُنتُمْ", "start_ms": 1845270, "end_ms": 1846540}, {"i": 5, "text": "ءَامَنتُم", "start_ms": 1846540, "end_ms": 1848960}, {"i": 6, "text": "بِٱللَّهِ", "start_ms": 1848960, "end_ms": 1849880}, {"i": 7, "text": "فَعَلَيْهِ", "start_ms": 1849880, "end_ms": 1850860}, {"i": 8, "text": "تَوَكَّلُوٓا۟", "start_ms": 1850860, "end_ms": 1853300}, {"i": 9, "text": "إِن", "start_ms": 1853300, "end_ms": 1854360}, {"i": 10, "text": "كُنتُم", "start_ms": 1854360, "end_ms": 1855840}, {"i": 11, "text": "مُّسْلِمِينَ", "start_ms": 1855840, "end_ms": 1859345}]}